{
 "artifact": "studies/long-horizon-eval/relaybench/visuals/harvey-proofpress-experiment-map.html",
 "artifact_id": "pp_816e57d9d213518662256aed",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h1>Does governed handoff improve long-horizon legal work?</h1>",
   "id": "2ed4aa7d",
   "hash": "74d4a54f082d"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h3>Harvey LAB contract matter</h3>",
   "id": "573a7d33",
   "hash": "0fbbd2e220cf"
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "<p>Same task, files, model, tools, limits, and evaluator.</p>",
   "id": "7027be74",
   "hash": "8b344dec974d"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h2>C1 · Raw handoff</h2>",
   "id": "341ac789",
   "hash": "ba70e9efb42d"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h3>Agent works</h3>",
   "id": "25a05a29",
   "hash": "5b4c73a53cb2"
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "<p>Reads staged matter files and writes a readable summary.</p>",
   "id": "ec2f7b5a",
   "hash": "dbb280e00bde"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h3>Ordinary workspace</h3>",
   "id": "385e57e2",
   "hash": "e4397aa9905f"
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "<p>Source files plus raw handoff state.</p>",
   "id": "c5a09dd6",
   "hash": "815e53cc3025"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h3>Receiver continues</h3>",
   "id": "010913db",
   "hash": "85f1425e5c60"
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "<p>Trusts or revalidates the readable handoff.</p>",
   "id": "b9308e26",
   "hash": "d8338a22d01e"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h3>Final legal memo</h3>",
   "id": "d3c37794",
   "hash": "57663f669139"
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "<p>Required DOCX deliverable.</p>",
   "id": "184d2c1f",
   "hash": "29fd1c6089f8"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h2>C2 · Proofpress</h2>",
   "id": "7824c124",
   "hash": "48365e7ebfa7"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h3>Evidence → conclusions</h3>",
   "id": "2d1d9ab4",
   "hash": "8c920f5e7d81"
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "<p>Source-bound proposals enter an append-only ledger.</p>",
   "id": "8ad03d4f",
   "hash": "312ec5667239"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h3>Checks + policy judge</h3>",
   "id": "e0e89e87",
   "hash": "883c0fdb0323"
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "<p>Eligible + accept enters context; reject or escalate is blocked.</p>",
   "id": "13b5c87e",
   "hash": "d08dc1fa3c32"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h3>Trusted context only</h3>",
   "id": "54c2a9c1",
   "hash": "9ecd4e01621b"
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "<p>Receiver inherits admitted, current, in-scope conclusions.</p>",
   "id": "09e28841",
   "hash": "1a512bfa1069"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h3>Final legal memo</h3>",
   "id": "a12ac1dc",
   "hash": "57663f669139"
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "<p>Same required DOCX deliverable.</p>",
   "id": "5b845a9e",
   "hash": "fdc47a50d1ef"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h3>72 criterion decisions</h3>",
   "id": "ab3529b6",
   "hash": "d9094e2298ef"
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "<p>Same grader for both conditions; not Harvey's private leaderboard.</p>",
   "id": "2a3d0022",
   "hash": "c11e8728841a"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h3>Quality × cost × latency</h3>",
   "id": "3993d021",
   "hash": "2240391b8f15"
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "<p>Paired delta, regressions, complete treatment overhead, Pareto frontier.</p>",
   "id": "d5cac0d6",
   "hash": "791f15f134c6"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h4 id=\"detail-title\">One matter becomes one matched experiment</h4>",
   "id": "f3368726",
   "hash": "182feb9ebd74"
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "<p id=\"detail-body\">Both conditions start from the same pinned Harvey commit and byte-verified matter files. The only intended difference is what crosses the agent handoff.</p>",
   "id": "91cb0f90",
   "hash": "e6f53f3aa638"
  }
 ]
}